	  first. Must be positive (preemptive) and numerically greater than
	  CONFIG_APP_PATTERN_CONTROLLER_THREAD_PRIORITY so the animation tick
	  thread can preempt it — enforced by a BUILD_ASSERT in src/imu/imu.cpp.
	  See fw/docs/threading.md for the system-wide priority map.

